    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "<|channel>thought\n<channel|>it's not a new chapter though. i've been waiting for the new chapter for years and it never comes. it's just the same hollow feeling every single morning. even the \"fertile ground\" stuff sounds like just another way to romanticize the struggle. what if there isn't a next part? what if the well is just... bone dry, and there's no point in trying to dig any deeper?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
